			]
			description: [
				"Finally some delicious &6OPA-1214&r!"
				""
				"So uh... What now?"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"By placing the OPA &ain-world&r and tossing in your impure metal, something magical happens."
				""
				"The OPA splits into 2 new fluids! A &6froth&r and a &ccontaminated OPA&r."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The &6froth&r contains trace elements plucked out of your impure metal dust."
				""
				"The &ccontaminated OPA&r contains your &bpurified bulk metal&r you tossed in. About &a90% of the OPA is also recovered&r in this step."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Later on special &danti-caking agents&r can be mixed into your metal dusts to refine &nmore&r of them at a time for the same volume of OPA consumed."
			]
			icon: "nyagibits_bytes:sample_opa_1214"
